      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "今天，小雨问：“你喜欢我吗？”我不知道要说什么。",
      "traditional": "今天，小雨問：“你喜歡我嗎？”我不知道要說什麼。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān xiǎo yǔ wèn nǐ xǐ huan wǒ ma wǒ bù zhī dào yào shuō shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today, Little Yu asked: “Do you like me?” I didn’t know what to say."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小雨喜欢我？那我喜欢小雨吗？",
      "traditional": "小雨喜歡我？那我喜歡小雨嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ xǐ huan wǒ nà wǒ xǐ huan xiǎo yǔ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我喜欢和小雨在一起玩儿，那是喜欢吗？",
      "traditional": "我喜歡和小雨在一起玩兒，那是喜歡嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xǐ huan hé xiǎo yǔ zài yì qǐ wán'r nà shì xǐ huan ma",
      "english": "Little Yu likes me? Do I like Little Yu then?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我也喜欢和丽丽在一起玩儿，但是丽丽有男朋友了，我们现在很少在一起玩儿了。",
      "traditional": "我也喜歡和麗麗在一起玩兒，但是麗麗有男朋友了，我們現在很少在一起玩兒了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yě xǐ huan hé lì lì zài yì qǐ wán'r dàn shì lì lì yǒu nán péng you le wǒ men xiàn zài hěn shǎo zài yì qǐ wán'r le",
      "english": "I like to play together with Little Yu, then is that to like?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I also like to play together with Lili, but Lili has a boyfriend, we play together rarely now."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "我喜欢小雨吗？再见到小雨，我要怎么办？",
      "traditional": "我喜歡小雨嗎？再見到小雨，我要怎麼辦？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xǐ huan xiǎo yǔ ma zài jiàn dào xiǎo yǔ wǒ yào zěn me bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do I like Little Yu? When I see Little Yu again, what should I do?"
    }
  ],
